      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sunlight colors it red. When the small ball is\ndrained of nutrients, it shrivels to herald evolution.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "日の光で　赤く　色づく。\n栄養分が　吸われて　小さい　玉が\nしぼむと　進化が　近い。",
